Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: emi <285864120+antarest47@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: apt (>= 2.4)
Description: Uzunyx's APT repository and its signing key
 Adds https://dl.uzunyx.com/repo to APT, signed with the Uzunyx archive key
 (971A 62FD 88B6 D53B 860F  B7DD 05D1 9D02 8CE7 A0BC), so that the Uzunyx
 packages update with the rest of the system.
